isine"]]},{"h":"Cookbooks","count":1,"rows":[{"name":"Mandarin Food and Cooking: 75 Regional Recipes from Beijing and Northern China","ref":"cookbook/mandarin-food-and-cooking-75-regional-recipes-from-beijing-and-northern-china","color":"#f0b340","shape":"book","sub":"Terry Tan, 2013","note":"Illustrated collection of Beijing and northern Chinese dishes by food writer Terry Tan.","url":"https://www.simonandschuster.net/books/Mandarin-Food-and-Cooking/Terry-Tan/9781908991003","suggested":true,"isbn":"9781908991003"}]},{"h":"Dishes","count":1,"links":[["Peking duck","dish/peking-duck"]]},{"h":"Key ingredients","links":[["Allium fistulosum","ingredient/allium-fistulosum"],["Duck as food","ingredient/duck-as-food"],["Spring pancake","ingredient/spring-pancake"],["Tianmianjiang","ingredient/tianmianjiang"]],"note":"Most used across its dishes."},{"h":"Part of","links":[["Chinese cuisine","cuisine/chinese-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Within Beijing cooking","count":2,"links":[["Chinese aristocrat cuisine","cuisine/chinese-aristocrat-cuisine"],["Chinese imperial cuisine","cuisine/chinese-imperial-cuisine"]]}],"cont":"Asian cuisine","img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/5/54/Dry_for_5_hours_cropped.jpg/500px-Dry_for_5_hours_cropped.jpg","w":500,"h":750,"by":"FotoosVanRobin","lic":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dry_for_5_hours_cropped.jpg"}},"cuisine/pontic-greek-cuisine":{"t":"cuisine","r":"cuisine/pontic-greek-cuisine","n":"Pontic Greek cuisine","c":"#f0b340","crumb":[["Asia","cuisines#asia"],["Turkish cuisine","cuisine/turkish-cuisine"],["Greek cuisine","cuisine/greek-cuisine"]],"sub":"Regional cuisine in Turkey","intro":[["Pontic Greek cuisine consists of foods traditionally eaten by Pontic Greeks, a Greek-speaking ethnic minority that originates from the southern shore of the Black Sea in modern Turkey. Their cuisine has been heavily influenced by the migration of different ethnic groups to 